    "sections": {
        "description": "YStudy is a modern, feature-rich WordPress education theme. designed for schools, colleges, universities, online courses, LMS platforms, instructors, and coaching centers. Built with the powerful Elementor page builder, it enables easy customization of course pages, instructor profiles, and educational content—without writing a single line of code. This fully responsive and SEO-optimized theme ensures top performance on all devices. YStudy integrates seamlessly with Tutor LMS, making it ideal for managing courses, creating quizzes, building forms, and organizing educational materials effortlessly. Advanced theme options powered by the Kirki Customizer give you full control over layouts, fonts, and color schemes. With clean code and fast loading speed, YStudy is perfect for professional e-learning websites. A one-click demo importer makes it quick and easy to launch your site with pre-built templates crafted specifically for education and training platforms."
    },
